---
import { buttonVariants } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { Brain, Users } from "lucide-react";
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-20 md:py-24 bg-muted/30">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 md:mb-16 px-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold mb-4 text-primary">
        Legacy, made real across 3 dimensions.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-foreground/80">
        At In the Room with Legacy, legacy isn't abstract. It's lived. Measured through tools, protected through conversations, and expressed through culture.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8 mt-8 md:mt-12">
      <!-- The Tool -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col h-full border border-border/30 hover:border-primary/30 transition-all hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="p-3 bg-primary/10 rounded-full w-fit mb-5">
          <Brain size={24} className="text-primary" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-3 text-primary">The Tool</h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-foreground/80 mb-6 flex-grow">
          AI-powered Legacy Assessment helps you understand where you are in your legacy journey and provides actionable steps forward.
        </p>
        <a 
          href="/tools/legacy-assessment" 
          class={buttonVariants({
            variant: "default",
            size: "default",
            class: "w-full justify-center mt-auto"
          })}
        >
          Take the Assessment
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- The Program -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col h-full border border-border/30 hover:border-primary/30 transition-all hover:shadow-lg">
        <div class="p-3 bg-secondary/20 rounded-full w-fit mb-5">
          <Users size={24} className="text-primary" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-3 text-primary">The Program</h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-foreground/80 mb-6 flex-grow">
          While We're Still Here Guided conversations that bring peace to life's transitions and preserve your family's stories, lessons, and love for generations to come.
        </p>
        <a 
          href="/programs/while-were-still-here" 
          class={buttonVariants({
            variant: "default",
            size: "default",
            class: "w-full justify-center mt-auto"
          })}
        >
          Learn More
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- The Network -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col h-full border border-border/30 hover:border-primary/30 transition-all hover:shadow-lg sm:col-span-2 md:col-span-1">
        <div class="p-3 bg-accent/20 rounded-full w-fit mb-5">
          <Users size={24} className="text-primary" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-display font-semibold mb-3 text-primary">The Network</h3>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-foreground/80 mb-6 flex-grow">
          Black Family Business Network: A founding cohort of leaders, heirs and families committed to building legacy together.
        </p>
        <a 
          href="/programs/black-family-business-network" 
          class={buttonVariants({
            variant: "default",
            size: "default",
            class: "w-full justify-center mt-auto"
          })}
        >
          Explore Network
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>